# HELP sglang:weight_load_duration_seconds Wall time of the most recent update_weights_from_<source> call on this scheduler rank (seconds). `source` label is one of: disk, distributed, tensor, ipc. Event-detection via changes(...[<range>]) > 0 — no separate counter needed.
# TYPE sglang:weight_load_duration_seconds gauge
sglang:weight_load_duration_seconds{engine_type="prefill",model_name="model_a",moe_ep_rank="0",pp_rank="0",source="disk",tp_rank="0"} 0
